        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8460, Octagon Single Cylinder Lost Wax Bronze Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Octagon Lost Wax Bronze Single Cylinder Deadbolt is a wonderful mixture of the old and new. The old world Lost Wax Bronze material and available finishes of either flat black or medium bronze paired with the unique octagon shape make for something that is surely eye catching. This single cylinder deadbolt is locked and unlocked by a key from the outside and a thumbturn on the inside. The Octagon Single Cylinder Lost Wax Bronze Deadbolt will fit 1-3/8 inch to 3 inch doors with 2-3/4 inch or 2-3/8 inch backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Lost Wax Cast Bronze Octagon Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Cast bronze collar and rosette.</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Octagon Bronze Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Trim Diameter: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Trim Projection: 3/4”</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Thickness: 5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-cast-bronze-finish.jpg?v=1704354518\" width=\"394\" height=\"189\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
